                        "review": "[h1]Pros:[/h1]\nLooks nice\nSounds nice\n\n[h1]Cons:[/h1]\nWeird steering/controls;\nNo tutorial\nNo keyboard support\nNo controller mapping\nNo player marker, I kept getting confused as to which car I was controlling when there were more than 3 cars on the screen\nOversensitive menu when selecting car color\nCar kept getting stuck on barriers\nCar jittered left and right when turning\nMaps feel crampt and small\n\n[h1]Final Thoughts:[/h1]\nThis game has an interesting concept. I would love to see how this game plays in the future with more refined controls and larger, different maps.",
